licensed CC BY 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).
Source: https://github.com/alwaysfoundation/always-platform, spec/schemas/.

- spec/upstream/always-pathway-v0.2.schema.json is the upstream schema,
  unchanged.
- spec/pathway-v0.2-formal.md restates the upstream standard and adds
  invariants, a state machine, conformance profiles and security and privacy
  considerations. Additions are marked with their source in section 7.
- schema/pathway-v0.2-strict.schema.json composes the upstream schema by
  reference and adds constraints.
- conformance/vectors are derived from the upstream example file.

